# .filesize-allow - paths tools/check_file_size.py measures but does not judge.
# Format: <path> <reason>. One entry per line; a reason is mandatory.
CHANGELOG.md a ledger grows one line per merged change and never shrinks
examples/rendered/demo.html generated by tools/build_examples.py, inlines every page asset, line count is no source-size signal
